{
  "slug": "tenderb",
  "name": "Tenderb",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "End-to-end government contract bid management — find opportunities on SAM.gov, qualify bids, analyze solicitations, write proposals, manage pricing, run color team reviews, and track your pipeline. Covers the full bid lifecycle from opportunity discovery through post-award analysis, plus procurement law, contract analysis, and compliance.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **17 skills**, **8 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (17): `bid-planning` (Create proposal response plans with volume structure, schedules, milestones, team assignments, and effort estimates), `bid-qualification` (Bid/No-Bid decision support for government contract opportunities), `capture-planning` (Pre-proposal strategy and capture planning for government contract opportunities), `checklist-filling` (Fill in Excel-based compliance checklists, compliance matrices, and tracking spreadsheets for government proposals), `company-profile` (Build and maintain your company profile for government contracting — capabilities, certifications, past performance history, SAM registration, NAICS…), `contract-analysis` (Analyze government contract terms against your own terms and conditions, company policies, and risk tolerance), `knowledge-management` (Manage the proposal content library — reusable boilerplate, past performance database, templates, and institutional knowledge), `opportunity-discovery` (Find and monitor government contract opportunities on SAM.gov, GovWin, state procurement portals, and other bid boards), and 9 more\n- **Commands** (8): `analyze` (Analyze RFP/RFQ/IFB solicitation documents), `dashboard` (View your bid pipeline — active proposals, upcoming deadlines, capacity, and win/loss metrics), `plan` (Create a proposal response plan with volume structure, color team review schedule, section assignments, and effort estimates), `review` (Conduct a color team review (Pink, Red, Gold, White Glove) of proposal drafts), `score` (Run a bid/no-bid qualification on a government contract opportunity), `search` (Find government contract opportunities on SAM.gov and Grants.gov), `setup` (Initialize or update your company profile for government contracting — NAICS codes, certifications, set-aside eligibility, past performance, and…), `write` (Write a specific proposal section optimized for evaluation criteria)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `tenderb-govcon-scout`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tenderb@claude-community` from `LemonBuzzer123/tenderb_claude_plugin`.",
